msgstr "改善神经肌肉状况的一般指南："

#: ../src/gui/app1/encoder.cs:4618
msgid ""
"Load: Perform exercises that develop maximum force (eccentric, isometric or "
"concentric)."
msgstr "负载：进行能发展最大力量的测试项（离心，等长或向心）。"

#: ../src/gui/app1/encoder.cs:4619
msgid "Then switch to exercises that develop eccentric force in short time."
msgstr "然后切换至能在短时间内产生离心力的运动。"

#: ../src/gui/app1/encoder.cs:4621
msgid ""
"Explode: Perform exercises that develop force in short time, and maximum "
"force."
msgstr "爆发力:进行在短时间内发展力量的测试项，并最大限度地发挥力量。"

#: ../src/gui/app1/encoder.cs:4622
msgid "Drive: Perform exercises where force is developed during more time."
msgstr "推力：在更长的时间里发展力量的测试项。"

