msgstr "其他测试的阈值"

#: ../src/gui/dialogThreshold.cs:117
msgid "Spurious signals are common on electronics."
msgstr "混杂信号在电子产品中很常见。"

#: ../src/gui/dialogThreshold.cs:118
msgid ""
"Threshold refers to the minimum value measurable and is the common way to "
"clean this spurious signals."
msgstr "阈值是指可测量的最小值，是清除这种混杂信号的常用方法。"

#: ../src/gui/dialogThreshold.cs:119
msgid "Threshold should be a value lower than expected values."
msgstr "阈值应该是一个低于预期值的值。"

#: ../src/gui/dialogThreshold.cs:121
msgid ""
"On database three different thresholds are stored: jumps, races and other "
"tests."
msgstr "在数据库中存储了三个不同的阈值：跳跃、竞速和其他测试。"

#: ../src/gui/dialogThreshold.cs:122
msgid "If you change these values they will be stored once test is executed."
msgstr "如果您更改了这些值，它们将在测试执行后被保存。"

#: ../src/gui/dialogThreshold.cs:124
msgid ""
"Usually threshold values should not be changed but this option is useful for "
"special cases."
msgstr "通常不应更改阈值，但此选项在特殊情况下很有用。"

#: ../src/gui/dialogThreshold.cs:128 ../src/gui/dialogThreshold.cs:141
msgid "Default value: 50 ms."
msgstr "默认值：50毫秒。"

#: ../src/gui/dialogThreshold.cs:129
msgid ""
"On jumps with contact platforms a value of 50 ms (3 cm jump approximately) "
"is enough to solve electronical problems."
msgstr "在有跳垫的跳跃中，50毫秒（大约3厘米跳跃高度）的值足以解决电子问题。"

#: ../src/gui/dialogThreshold.cs:130
msgid ""
"You may change this value if you have a jumper that loses pressure with the "
"platform while going down previous to a CMJ or ABK jump."
msgstr ""
"如果您有一个在进行反向纵跳或摆臂跳之前在平台上下降时失去压力的跳板，您可以更"
"改此值。"

#: ../src/gui/dialogThreshold.cs:131
msgid ""
"This jumper should change his technique, but if it's difficult, a solution "
"is to increase threshold."
msgstr "这个跳跃者应该改变他的技术，但如果很难，一个解决办法是增加阈值。"

#: ../src/gui/dialogThreshold.cs:135
msgid "Default value: 10 ms."
msgstr "默认值：10毫秒。"

#: ../src/gui/dialogThreshold.cs:136
msgid "On races with photocells a value of 10 ms is the default value."
msgstr "在使用计时灯时的竞速中，默认值为10毫秒。"

#: ../src/gui/dialogThreshold.cs:137
msgid ""
"As Chronojump manages double contacts on photocells, changing threshold "
"value is not very common."
msgstr "因为Chronojump管理计时灯上的双触点，所以改变阈值并不常见。"

#: ../src/gui/dialogThreshold.cs:142
msgid "Depending on the test, user could change values."
msgstr "根据测试，用户可以更改值。"

