#: ../src/runType.cs:189
msgid "20Yard Agility test"
msgstr "20码敏捷性测试"

#: ../src/runType.cs:191
msgid ""
"This test is part of a battery for the USA Women's Soccer Team. The NFL use "
"a very similar test for the NFL Combine Testing, the 20 yard shuttle."
msgstr ""
"这项测试是美国女足测试的一部分。美国国家橄榄球联盟在NFL联合测试中使用了一个非"
"常相似的测试，20码往返。"

#: ../src/runType.cs:193 ../src/runType.cs:267
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "目的"

#: ../src/runType.cs:194
msgid ""
"The 20 yard agility race is a simple measure of an athlete’s ability to "
"accelerate, decelerate, change direction, and to accelerate again."
msgstr "20码敏捷赛跑是对运动员加速、减速、变向和再次加速能力的简单衡量。"

#: ../src/runType.cs:196 ../src/runType.cs:214 ../src/runType.cs:233
#: ../src/runType.cs:270 ../src/runType.cs:298
msgid "Procedure"
msgstr "步骤"

#: ../src/runType.cs:197
msgid ""
"Set up three marker cones in a straight line, exactly five yards apart - "
"cones B, A(center) and C. At each cone place a line across using marking "
"tape. The timer is positioned at the level of the center A cone, facing the "
"athlete. The athlete straddles the center cone A with feet an equal distance "
"apart and parallel to the line of cones. When ready, the athlete runs to "
"cone B (touching the line with either foot), turns and accelerates to cone C "
"(touching the line), and finishes by accelerating through the line at cone "
"A. The stopwatch is started on the first movement of the athlete and stops "
"the watch when the athlete’s torso crosses the center line."
msgstr ""
"在一条直线上设置三个标记圆锥体，间距5码——圆锥体B，A（位于中心）和C。在每个锥"
"体下标记直线。计时器位于A圆锥体中心的水平面上，面向运动员。运动员跨立于圆锥体"
"A中心，两脚距离A圆锥距离一致，平行于圆锥体的直线。准备好后，运动员跑到圆锥体B"
"处(两脚触线)，转身加速跑到圆锥体C处(触线)，最后在圆锥体A处加速过线。秒表从运"
"动员第一个动作开始计时，当运动员的躯干过中心线时，秒表停止计时。"

#: ../src/runType.cs:199 ../src/runType.cs:274
msgid "Scoring"
msgstr "评分"

#: ../src/runType.cs:200
msgid "Record the best time of two trials."
msgstr "记录两次测试中的最佳成绩。"

#: ../src/runType.cs:202
msgid ""
"Encourage athletes to accelerate through the finish line to maximize their "
"result."
msgstr "鼓励运动员加速通过终点线，使他们的成绩最佳。"

#: ../src/runType.cs:204 ../src/runType.cs:220 ../src/runType.cs:254
#: ../src/runType.cs:287 ../src/runType.cs:308
msgid "Cited with permission."
msgstr "经许可引用。"

#: ../src/runType.cs:212
msgid "505 Agility test"
msgstr "505敏捷性测试"

#: ../src/runType.cs:215
msgid ""
"Markers are set up 5 and 15 meters from a line marked on the ground. The "
"athlete runs from the 15 meter marker towards the line (run in distance to "
"build up speed) and through the 5 m markers, turns on the line and runs back "
"through the 5 m markers. The time is recorded from when the athletes first "
"runs through the 5 meter marker, and stopped when they return through these "
"markers (that is, the time taken to cover the 5 m up and back distance - 10 "
"m total). The best of two trails is recorded. The turning ability on each "
"leg should be tested. The subject should be encouraged to not overstep the "
"line by too much, as this will increase their time."
msgstr ""
"在地面标记一条直线，并在距离该直线5米和15米的地方设置标记。运动员从15米标记处"
"助跑加速穿过5米标记跑向直线，过直线后转身，跑回5米标记处。记录从运动员第一次"
"跑过5米标记到折返回标记时的时间(即往返跑完5米的时间-总共10米)。记录表现最好的"
"两次。应该测试每条腿的转弯能力。应该鼓励运动员不要过分超过直线，因为这会增加"
"他们的测试时间。"

#: ../src/runType.cs:218
msgid ""
"This is a test of 180 degree turning ability. This ability may not be "
"applicable to some sports."
msgstr "这是一个180度转向能力测试。这种能力可能不适用于某些运动。"

#: ../src/runType.cs:228
msgid "Illinois Agility test"
msgstr "伊利诺伊敏捷测验"

#: ../src/runType.cs:231
msgid ""
"The length of the course is 10 meters and the width (distance between the "
"start and finish points) is 5 meters. Four cones are used to mark the start, "
"finish and the two turning points. Another four cones are placed down the "
"center an equal distance apart. Each cone in the center is spaced 3.3 meters "
"apart."
msgstr ""
"跑道长度为10米，宽度（起点和终点之间的距离）为5米。四个圆锥体用于标记起点、终"
"点和两个转折点。另外四个圆锥体以等距放置在中间。居中的每个圆锥体间隔3.3米。"

#: ../src/runType.cs:234
msgid ""
"Subjects should lie on their front (head to the start line) and hands by "
"their shoulders. On the 'Go' command the stopwatch is started, and the "
"athlete gets up as quickly as possible and runs around the course in the "
"direction indicated, without knocking the cones over, to the finish line, at "
"which the timing is stopped."
msgstr ""
"测试对象应该趴在前方（头朝起跑线），双手放在肩膀旁边。在“开始”指令下，秒表开"
"始计时，运动员尽快站起并沿着指定方向绕过赛道跑到终点，不得推倒锥桶。在终点处"
"停止计时。"

#: ../src/runType.cs:237
msgid "The table below gives some rating scores (in seconds) for the test"
msgstr "下表列出了一些测试的评分（以秒为单位）"

#: ../src/runType.cs:238
msgid "Rating"
msgstr "评分"

#: ../src/runType.cs:238
msgid "Males"
msgstr "男"

#: ../src/runType.cs:238
msgid "Females"
msgstr "女"

#: ../src/runType.cs:239
msgid "Excellent"
msgstr "极好"

#: ../src/runType.cs:240
msgid "Good"
msgstr "好"

#: ../src/runType.cs:242
msgid "Fair"
msgstr "一般"

#: ../src/runType.cs:243
msgid "Poor"
msgstr "差"

#: ../src/runType.cs:245 ../src/runType.cs:281
msgid "Advantages"
msgstr "优势"

#: ../src/runType.cs:246
msgid ""
"This is a simple test to administer, requiring little equipment. Can test "
"players ability to turn in different directions, and different angles."
msgstr ""
"这是一个简单的测试，只需要很少的设备。可以测试运动员在不同方向和不同角度转向"
"的能力。"

#: ../src/runType.cs:248
msgid "Disadvantages"
msgstr "劣势"

#: ../src/runType.cs:249
msgid ""
"Choice of footwear and surface of area can effect times greatly. Results can "
"be subject to timing inconsistencies, which may be overcome by using timing "
"gates. Cannot distinguish between left and right turning ability."
msgstr ""
"鞋类选择和测试表面的差异可以极大地影响测试成绩。结果可能受到计时不一致性的影"
"响，可以通过使用计时门来克服这一问题。测试无法区分左右转向能力。"

#: ../src/runType.cs:251 ../src/runType.cs:277
msgid "Variations"
msgstr "变式"

#: ../src/runType.cs:252
msgid ""
"The starting and finishing sides can be swapped, so that turning direction "
"is changed."
msgstr "起点和终点的位置可以交换，以改变转向方向。"

#: ../src/runType.cs:263
msgid "Shuttle Run Agility test"
msgstr "折返跑敏捷性测试"

#: ../src/runType.cs:265
msgid ""
"This test describes the procedures as used in the President's Challenge "
"Fitness Awards. The variations listed give other ways to also perform this "
"test."
msgstr ""
"这个测试描述了总统挑战健身奖的流程。列出的变式提供了执行这个测试的其他方法。"

#: ../src/runType.cs:268
msgid "This is a test of speed and agility, important in many sports."
msgstr "这是一项速度和敏捷性的测试，在许多体育运动中都很重要。"

#: ../src/runType.cs:271
msgid ""
"This test requires the person to run back and forth between two parallel "
"lines as fast as possible. Set up two lines of cones 30 feet apart or use "
"line markings, and place two blocks of wood or a similar object behind one "
"of the lines. Starting at the line opposite the blocks, on the signal "
"'Ready? Go!' the participant runs to the other line, picks up a block and "
"returns to place it behind the starting line, then returns to pick up the "
"second block, then runs with it back across the line."
msgstr ""
"这个测试要求运动员在两条平行线之间尽可能快地来回跑。设置两条相距30英尺的标记"
"线，并在其中一条线后面放置两块木头或类似的物体。从未放置物体的线出发，当听"
"到“预备，跑！”之后，运动员出发跑向另一条线，拿起一块物体并跑回将其放在起点线"
"后面，然后返回拿起第二块物体，拿着它跑回起点。"

#: ../src/runType.cs:275
msgid ""
"Two or more trails may be performed, and the quickest time is recorded. "
"Results are recorded to the nearest tenth of a second."
msgstr "可以进行两次或更多次尝试，记录最快的时间。结果以0.1秒为单位记录。"

#: ../src/runType.cs:277 ../src/runType.cs:301
msgid "Modifications"
msgstr "变型"

#: ../src/runType.cs:278
msgid ""
"The test procedure can be varied by changing the number of shuttles "
"performed, the distance between turns (some use 10 meters rather than 30 "
"feet) and by removing the need for the person pick up and return objects "
"from the turning points."
msgstr ""
"测试程序可以通过改变进行的折返次数、转弯之间的距离（有些使用10米而不是30英"
"尺），以及取消需要在转弯点拾取和返回物体的要求来进行变化。"

#: ../src/runType.cs:282
msgid ""
"This test can be conducted on large groups relatively quickly with minimal "
"equipment required."
msgstr "这个测试可以在相对较短的时间内在大群体中进行，所需的设备也很少。"

#: ../src/runType.cs:285
msgid ""
"The blocks should be placed at the line, not thrown across them. Also make "
"sure the participants run through the finish line to maximize their score."
msgstr ""
"方块应该被放置在线上，而不是扔过线。同时确保测试对象跑过终点线，以使他们尽可"
"能多得分。"

#: ../src/runType.cs:296
msgid "ZigZag Agility test"
msgstr "之字敏捷性测试"

#: ../src/runType.cs:299
msgid ""
"Similar to the Shuttle Run test, this test requires the athlete to run a "
"course in the shortest possible time. A standard zig zag course is with four "
"cones placed on the corners of a rectangle 10 by 16 feet, with one more cone "
"placed in the centre. If the cones are labelled 1 to 4 around the rectangle "
"going along the longer side first, and the centre cone is C, the test begins "
"at 1, then to C, 2, 3, C, 4, then back to 1."
msgstr ""
"类似于折返跑测试，这个测试要求运动员在尽可能短的时间内完成一段路程。标准的之"
"字敏捷性测试是在一个10乘16英尺的矩形上放置四个锥桶，中间再放置一个锥桶。如果"
"沿着较长的一边按1到4标记矩形上的锥桶，中心锥桶标记为C，测试从1开始，然后到C，"
"2，3，C，4，最后回到1。"

#: ../src/runType.cs:302
msgid ""
"This test procedure can be modified by changing the distance between cones, "
"and the number of circuits performed."
msgstr "这个测试程序可以通过改变锥桶之间的距离和完成的循环次数来进行修改。"

#: ../src/runType.cs:305
msgid ""
"The total distance run should not be too great so that fatigue does not "
"become a factor."
msgstr "总跑步距离不应太大，以免疲劳成为一个影响因素。"

#: ../src/runType.cs:325
msgid "Margaria-Kalamen"
msgstr "楼梯冲刺爆发力测试"

#: ../src/runType.cs:333
msgid "Run n laps x distance"
msgstr "跑n段x距离"

#: ../src/runType.cs:340
msgid "Make max laps in n seconds"
msgstr "在n秒内跑完最多段数"

#: ../src/runType.cs:348
msgid "Continue running in n distance"
msgstr "继续跑n距离"

#: ../src/runType.cs:355
msgid "Run 10 times a 20m distance"
msgstr "跑10次每次20米距离"

#: ../src/runType.cs:362
msgid "Make max laps in 30 seconds"
msgstr "在30秒内跑的最多段数"

#: ../src/runType.cs:370
msgid "Continue running in 20m distance"
msgstr "继续跑20米"

#: ../src/runType.cs:378
msgid "Modified time Getup and Go test"
msgstr "改进的起身走动测试"

#. this intervallic race has different distance for each lap
#: ../src/runType.cs:381
msgid ""
"The instructions given to perform the test were as follows: \"Sit down with "
"your back resting on the back of the chair and with your two arms resting on "
"your legs. When you hear the word 'go', stand up without using your arms, "
"kick the ball in front of you as hard as you possibly can, using the instep "
"of the foot you feel the safest. Then walk at your normal pace while "
"counting backwards from 15 to 0 out loud. Turn around back the cone, without "
"touching it, and go back to your seat, stepping into the circles, trying not "
"to touch any of them. Finally, sit down again, trying not to use your arms\"."
msgstr ""
"测试说明如下：“坐下，背靠在椅背上，双手放在腿上。当你听到“开始”这个词的时候，"
"不要使用胳膊辅助站起来，用你觉得最安全的脚背位置和最大的力踢你面前的球。然后"
"以正常速度走路，同时大声从15倒数到0。从圆锥体转向回来，不要碰到它，之后回到你"
"的座位，踏入圆圈并尽量不要碰它们。最后，再次坐下，尽量不使用你的手臂”。"

#: ../src/runType.cs:383
msgid ""
"The stopwatches were activated on the word 'go' and the button that saved "
"the time intervals was pressed also after the following stages: when the "
"subject stood up and kicked the ball; when the ball passed the 8 m line; and "
"when the subject returned to the seated position in the same chair (42 cm "
"height from the seat to the ground). The total time needed to perform the "
"test provided a quantitative evaluation of performance. A qualitative "
"evaluation was performed by the completion of an AQ. This AQ assesses 6 "
"items with a Likert scale from 0 to 3, where 0 is the equivalent to needing "
"help in order to perform the task, and 3 is equivalent to performing the "
"task unaided with no mistakes. The maximum points that can be attained are "
"18. The items assessed were: (1) standing up from the chair, (2) kicking the "
"ball, (3) walking whilst counting backwards from 15 to 0, (4) walking around "
"the cone, (5) walking whilst stepping into the circles, and (6) sitting back "
"down again."
msgstr ""
"秒表在听到“开始”时启动，同时在以下阶段按下保存时间间隔的按钮：当受试者站起并"
"踢球时；当球越过8米线时；以及当受试者回到同一把椅子坐下（座位到地面高度为42厘"
"米）。完成测试所需的总时间提供了对表现的定量评估。通过完成一个AQ进行定性评"
"估。该AQ使用Likert量表评估6个项目，分数从0到3，其中0相当于需要帮助才能完成任"
"务，而3相当于无需帮助且没有错误地完成任务。最高可获得18分。评估的项目包括："
"（1）从椅子上站起，（2）踢球，（3）一边倒数从15到0一边行走，（4）绕过锥桶行"
"走，（5）一边踏入圆圈一边行走，以及（6）重新坐下。"

#: ../src/runType.cs:384
msgid "Assessment questionnaire"
msgstr "评估问卷"

#: ../src/runType.cs:385
msgid ""
"Once the test finishes proceed to edit and you will be able to complete the "
"assessment questionnaire."
msgstr "测试完成后，继续编辑，您将能够完成评估问卷。"

